{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In &quot;Jenin Story&quot; you will gather and grow your Jenin squad. Get resources by auto battle, then use these resources to make your Jenin stronger, and then challenge more difficult scenarios, unlock and collect new Jenin.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and cultivate Jenin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely assign attribute points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freedom to match Jenin's talent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusion Jenin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.<strong>City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blacksmith: Crafting equipment, talent scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furnace: Enhanced decomposition equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunting Lodge: Hunt and Get Jenin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idol: Fusion of two Jenin with a chance of getting the legendary Jenin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/\u4e3b\u57ce.gif?t=1752822654\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.<strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battle of &quot;Jenin Story&quot; is turn-based battle. Each Jenin has 1 skill. When the magic is insufficient, he will use normal attack (which can be changed after evolution), and when the magic is sufficient, he will release the skill<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/\u6218\u6597.gif?t=1752822654\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. <strong>Cultivation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free learning talent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea